1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:58,200
The first Suzaku sacrificed himself

25
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:03,330
along with 9 Middle stage Ascendant cultivators

26
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:06,720
to make the 5 Sealing Swords

27
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:11,570
and seal the Forsaken Immortal Clan for tens of thousands of years.

28
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:13,080
But today,

29
00:02:13,880 --> 00:02:17,250
Original Ancestor of the
Forsaken Immortal Clan
11-Leaf

30
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:16,720
this old man can rival peak Ascendant !

31
00:02:16,920 --> 00:02:20,960
No one can stop my clan from taking back planet Fu Wen !

32
00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:29,960
Back then,

33
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:32,880
this old man was but a coward

34
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:37,370
who had to watch countless clan members die.

35
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:40,370
For tens of thousands of years,

36
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:43,760
they fed me the lives of my own brethren

37
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:46,920
because I was the Ancestor.

38
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:50,000
This old man is a sinner...

39
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:52,360
I deserve to die...

40
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:57,040
I will be sealed by these swords

41
00:02:57,560 --> 00:03:00,290
in place of the Forsaken Immortal Tree.

42
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:03,840
I offer my soul

43
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:06,040
as sacrifice.

44
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:08,120
In exchange,

45
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:11,090
the Forsaken Immortal Clan

46
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:12,640
will be free !

47
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:17,130
I will die for the Dao

48
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:18,720
so that my clan

49
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,920
may walk this earth again !

50
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:31,130
Ancestral Spirit Tree
Forsaken Immortal Clan

51
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,440
Forsaken Immortal Clan,

52
00:03:55,640 --> 00:03:57,640
bid farewell to the Ancestor.

53
00:03:58,040 --> 00:04:00,760
Farewell Ancestor.

54
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:03,130
Take back the planet !

55
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:04,160
Kill !

56
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,360
Kill !

57
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:06,520
Kill !

58
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,920
Kill !

59
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:16,040
As the 14th generation Suzaku,

60
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:20,010
I command all countries of planet Suzaku

61
00:04:20,280 --> 00:04:22,080
to wage war against

62
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:24,930
the Forsaken Immortal Clan !

63
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:46,610
Even if I'm one step from Soul Transformation,

64
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:48,770
the amount of celestial jades I have

65
00:04:48,520 --> 00:04:51,250
is far from enough to breakthrough.

66
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:53,410
Celestial jades are rare.

67
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:56,250
I must return to the Soul Refining Sect first

68
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:59,210
to seek Senior Du Tian’s guidance.

69
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:06,530
This is…

70
00:05:07,640 --> 00:05:10,010
the Forsaken Immortal Clan ?

71
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:15,890
Country of Zhao

72
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,850
Wang Zhuo
Xuan Dao Sect Elder
Late stage Core Formation

73
00:05:31,200 --> 00:05:32,290
Be careful !

74
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,690
Junior Brother !

75
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:44,010
You Forsaken Immortal bandits,

76
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:45,210
come out and face me !

77
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,370
That’s…

78
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:53,530
Pang Long
Forsaken Immortal Clan
6-Leaf Shaman

79
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,960
a 6-leaf Shaman !

80
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:56,120
Little brats

81
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:58,490
you can keep trying,

82
00:05:58,240 --> 00:06:00,280
I'm not done playing with you.

83
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:03,480
Since you refuse to surrender,

84
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:06,560
I let my Juniors will practice on you !

85
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:27,280
I’ll fight you to the death !

86
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:42,000
Boring.

87
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:43,840
Die !

88
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,480
Break.

89
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:04,890
Who’s there ?!

90
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:09,040
Soul Transformation !

91
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,520
Run !

92
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,170
Mosquito Beast !

93
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:36,210
When you reach Nascent Soul,

94
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:38,480
you will remember the past.

95
00:07:39,400 --> 00:07:40,810
It’s you ?

96
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:44,050
The Senior that reached Soul Formation at Heng Yue...

97
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:45,730
A few years have passed

98
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:48,530
and you’re already at Late stage Core Formation.

99
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:49,320
Not bad.

100
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:54,370
Unfortunately, I haven't managed to form a Nascent Soul.

101
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:57,130
I’ll help you.

102
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:19,010
Wang Zhuo
Xuan Dao Sect Elder
Early stage Nascent Soul

103
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:25,660
Wang Lin...

104
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:27,760
Thank you.

105
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:30,650
We're the last remnants of the Wang Family,

106
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:32,890
you don't need to thank me.

107
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:36,730
Times have changed...

108
00:08:37,880 --> 00:08:40,930
We once took the Spirit Root test together.

109
00:08:40,920 --> 00:08:42,890
Who could’ve imagined

110
00:08:42,680 --> 00:08:45,410
that things would turn out like this ?

111
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,650
What happened

112
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:49,130
for planet Suzaku to be in this state ?

113
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:50,410
You don’t know !?

114
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:52,090
These past few years,

115
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:54,130
I haven’t been on planet Suzaku.

116
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:57,000
Wang Lin’s cultivation

117
00:08:57,880 --> 00:09:00,330
can now traverse the void...

118
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,240
3 years ago,

119
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:08,010
the Forsaken Immortal Clan declared war against Suzaku.

120
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:10,720
The country of Suzaku called all countries for help in the war.

121
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,970
But who would've thought

122
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:15,250
that the Forsaken Immortal Clan plotted for millennia.

123
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:17,450
They had sent 9 cultivators to the surface

124
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:19,770
to infiltrate important countries.

125
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:22,570
Now, these 9 all hold key positions.

126
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:24,650
Only 5 of them have been exposed.

127
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,410
But with their help from within,

128
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:28,840
the country of Suzaku was forced to retreat.

129
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,530
To try to turn the tide,

130
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:34,410
Qian Feng challenged the Forsaken Immortal Clan's young patriarch alone.

131
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:36,090
After 3 days and 3 nights,

132
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:37,280
Their duel

133
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:38,800
ended in a draw.

134
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:41,570
After the stalemate,

135
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:45,170
the Forsaken Immortal Clan agreed to a truce.

136
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:48,290
But no one expected

137
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:50,600
that the condition for this truce

138
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:54,080
was for Suzaku to cede all countries under rank 4

139
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:57,640
and hand over their cultivators and gifted children.

140
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,240
Since then

141
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:03,680
all rank 3 countries have been in this state.

142
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:06,290
Some were forced to surrender

143
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:08,130
and others refused to yield,

144
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:10,370
becoming a living hell.

145
00:10:11,680 --> 00:10:13,880
Our Country of Zhao is struggling to hold on.

146
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:16,030
We're at our wit's end.

147
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,890
The mission of our squad

148
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:19,680
was to get help from a rank 4 country

149
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:22,560
in hope that someone will accept to shelter us.

150
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,450
But...

151
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:27,250
not only did they coldly refuse

152
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:29,890
but they even mocked us for resisting.

153
00:10:30,280 --> 00:10:32,290
And problems never come alone,

154
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:35,650
we were ambushed by the Forsaken Immortal Clan on our way back.

155
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:37,530
I fear it won't be long

156
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:39,210
before Zhao falls too.

157
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:40,960
Wang Lin,

158
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:43,970
can you return to Zhao ?

159
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:53,090
Master,

160
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:55,690
if this Senior is so powerful,

161
00:10:55,680 --> 00:10:58,210
couldn't he resolve our country's crisis ?

162
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:01,850
If he helps us,

163
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:03,930
he'd make enemies of both sides.

164
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:06,080
In these times,

165
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:09,320
no one wants be in this kind of situation.

166
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:20,400
Your Highness

167
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:22,810
3 children in the capital

168
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:24,920
were already taken by the outsiders.

169
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:24,370
Wang Qi
Prince of Zhao

170
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:24,370
Queen consort of Zhao

171
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:26,570
Wang Yu
Crown prince of Zhao

172
00:11:25,400 --> 00:11:28,360
Are you sure that place can protect Yu'er ?

173
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:30,240
I'm not sure.

174
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:32,410
But my great-grandfather told me

175
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:34,360
the family's oldest rule:

176
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:36,810
When facing annihilation,

177
00:11:36,920 --> 00:11:38,810
enter the Ancestral Home

178
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:40,410
and your life will be saved.

179
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:43,120
What's so special about that Ancestral Home ?

180
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:46,330
Before our Wang Family came to the capital,

181
00:11:46,520 --> 00:11:49,370
one of us became a powerful Immortal.

182
00:11:49,560 --> 00:11:51,080
He's known as the Ancestor.

183
00:11:51,800 --> 00:11:53,170
The Ancestral Home

184
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:55,570
must contain something he left.

185
00:11:55,640 --> 00:11:57,410
But after all these years,

186
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:59,050
I'm not sure if it's true.

187
00:12:00,040 --> 00:12:02,880
Where have all the Immortals from the capital gone ?

188
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:05,560
They could've protected us !

189
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:09,120
They returned to their sects to fight.

190
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:10,240
If defeated,

191
00:12:10,800 --> 00:12:12,520
they'll gather at a designated place.

192
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,970
The Sect Formation is falling !

193
00:12:30,920 --> 00:12:33,170
Wufeng Valley

194
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:35,920
Everyone, retreat to Heng Yue Mountain !

195
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:37,040
Hurry !

196
00:12:48,680 --> 00:12:50,650
Did you tell everyone ?

197
00:12:50,800 --> 00:12:52,640
They all went to Heng Yue Mountain.

198
00:12:53,880 --> 00:12:55,010
Let's go !

199
00:13:02,680 --> 00:13:04,370
Quick, into the Ancestral Home !

200
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:09,280
You run quite fast

201
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:18,130
Your Highness...

202
00:13:17,920 --> 00:13:20,410
Hand over this children with a Spirit Root

203
00:13:20,160 --> 00:13:21,760
and I'll spare your lives.

204
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:23,960
Never !

205
00:13:29,640 --> 00:13:31,960
Your country is interesting,

206
00:13:32,400 --> 00:13:34,320
why did you gather here like this ?

207
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:36,360
Does this place

208
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:38,640
hide some artifacts ?

209
00:13:39,920 --> 00:13:41,840
You're welcome to try.

210
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:43,680
Interesting !

211
00:13:44,280 --> 00:13:45,640
Let me see

212
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:49,000
what makes you so confident.

213
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,930
The Ancestor !

214
00:14:10,920 --> 00:14:12,810
He really exists...

215
00:14:19,400 --> 00:14:22,250
This is the legacy of the Ancestor of Zhao,

216
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:23,890
it will surely protect us !

217
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:26,880
The Ancestor has appeared !

218
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:29,240
The Ancestor has appeared !

219
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:31,880
I knew he would protect us !

220
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:36,200
It's actually a domain artifact...

221
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:38,880
Greetings, Elder !

222
00:14:38,640 --> 00:14:42,240
But its owner's cultivation is too weak.

223
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:41,170
Mo Luo
Forsaken Immortal Clan
6-Leaf Shaman

224
00:14:44,040 --> 00:14:46,680
Merely Early stage Soul Formation...

225
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:49,400
Even if he came here personally,

226
00:14:49,680 --> 00:14:51,840
he wouldn't survive,

227
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:54,440
let alone his artifact.

228
00:14:59,640 --> 00:15:01,650
The country's artifact is attacked !

229
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:02,960
what do we do ?

230
00:15:06,200 --> 00:15:08,560
This object is intriguing.

231
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:12,760
It would be a pity to destroy it.

232
00:15:26,640 --> 00:15:29,040
It's a real treasure !

233
00:15:34,040 --> 00:15:36,440
For this object's sake,

234
00:15:36,840 --> 00:15:39,160
I won't make things difficult for you.

235
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:42,960
Become vassals of our Forsaken Immortal Clan

236
00:15:42,720 --> 00:15:46,040
and you'll far better than under Suzaku.

237
00:15:46,600 --> 00:15:47,960
What do you think ?

238
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:49,050
Dream on !

239
00:15:48,800 --> 00:15:52,880
We'll defend Zhao to the death !

240
00:15:52,640 --> 00:15:54,440
We'll never surrender !

241
00:15:54,440 --> 00:15:55,840
In that case,

242
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:57,360
the Country of Zhao

243
00:15:57,720 --> 00:16:00,120
shall be destroyed today !

244
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:11,680
You

245
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:14,080
are unworthy.

246
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:33,840
Ancestor !

247
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:35,600
Ancestor !

248
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:37,920
Ancestor !

249
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:39,760
Ancestor !

250
00:16:40,880 --> 00:16:43,360
His cultivation is unfathomable.

251
00:16:43,840 --> 00:16:46,160
At first glance, Peak Late stage Soul Formation

252
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:49,640
but it contains a strange power...

253
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:52,530
Hand over

254
00:16:53,200 --> 00:16:54,610
the wood carving.

255
00:16:57,400 --> 00:16:58,570
Tattoo,

256
00:16:58,400 --> 00:16:59,530
explode !

257
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:10,490
What !?

258
00:17:10,240 --> 00:17:13,440
He neutralized my attack so easily ?

259
00:17:14,280 --> 00:17:17,240
It's just a rank 3 country's Ancestor

260
00:17:17,720 --> 00:17:20,290
but he's a Soul Transformation old monster !

261
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:22,720
Why is this happening to me ?

262
00:17:26,600 --> 00:17:28,770
Did I allow you to leave ?

263
00:17:31,760 --> 00:17:32,890
Sir,

264
00:17:33,080 --> 00:17:35,800
we have a truce with Suzaku.

265
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:38,240
Do you dare to break it ?

266
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:40,480
So what if I do ?

267
00:18:04,520 --> 00:18:06,530
Since it has come to this,

268
00:18:06,280 --> 00:18:09,160
I must use the Reincarnation Tree's power to go back !

269
00:18:25,840 --> 00:18:26,980
Stop !

270
00:18:36,080 --> 00:18:37,970
If you kill me,

271
00:18:37,800 --> 00:18:40,730
there will be a lingering tattoo curse on you.

272
00:18:40,560 --> 00:18:42,250
When my Seniors see it

273
00:18:42,080 --> 00:18:43,600
they will kill you.

274
00:18:43,400 --> 00:18:45,330
I have already killed quite a few

275
00:18:45,120 --> 00:18:47,320
Forsaken Immortal Clan members.

276
00:18:47,800 --> 00:18:49,520
6-leaf Warrior ?

277
00:18:49,880 --> 00:18:51,600
And even Shamans !

278
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:53,250
No...

279
00:18:53,160 --> 00:18:55,120
Impossible !

280
00:18:54,880 --> 00:18:56,130
Absorb !

281
00:19:11,680 --> 00:19:14,440
Junior Zhen Fengxiao of the Xuan Dao Sect

282
00:19:14,480 --> 00:19:16,440
pays respects to Ancestor.

283
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:19,650
I'm not your Ancestor.

284
00:19:19,800 --> 00:19:21,690
Note: they say 200 but it's incorrect

285
00:19:19,800 --> 00:19:21,690
100 years ago,

286
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:24,130
when you reached Soul Formation at the Xuan Dao Sect,

287
00:19:23,880 --> 00:19:26,010
you earned the title of Ancestor.

288
00:19:26,160 --> 00:19:27,330
And now,

289
00:19:27,280 --> 00:19:29,200
you've saved Zhao

290
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:30,880
from certain destruction.

291
00:19:31,080 --> 00:19:33,450
Fulfilling the Ancestor's role.

292
00:19:33,760 --> 00:19:37,440
You are Zhao rightful Ancestor !

293
00:19:40,800 --> 00:19:41,920
My son,

294
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:44,160
it doesn't matter if you aren't chosen.

295
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:46,610
You can always come back home,

296
00:19:46,360 --> 00:19:47,840
you still have your parents.

297
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:50,840
500 years have passed...

298
00:19:58,640 --> 00:20:01,440
We pay Respects to Zhao's Ancestor !

299
00:20:03,480 --> 00:20:05,530
Lectures on cultivation

300
00:20:05,520 --> 00:20:07,890
to clarify the right path

301
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:12,450
will help Core Formations form Nascent Souls.

302
00:20:14,120 --> 00:20:15,890
Seeing a domain

303
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:18,290
and understanding the heavens

304
00:20:19,120 --> 00:20:21,600
gives Nascent Souls hope for Soul Formation.

305
00:20:22,760 --> 00:20:24,610
Stronger formations

306
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:26,590
will help resist invaders.

307
00:20:26,800 --> 00:20:29,120
Only a Soul Transformation can break them.

308
00:20:30,320 --> 00:20:32,080
The future of Zhao

309
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:35,000
will depend on their own fate.

310
00:20:49,120 --> 00:20:51,050
Have you decided ?

311
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:56,610
In both my lives,

312
00:20:56,600 --> 00:20:58,560
the Wang Family raised me.

313
00:20:58,880 --> 00:21:00,650
All I want now

314
00:21:01,240 --> 00:21:03,570
is to spend my remaining time

315
00:21:03,320 --> 00:21:05,570
protecting future generations !

316
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:08,810
Matters of the past

317
00:21:08,600 --> 00:21:10,210
end here.

318
00:21:11,600 --> 00:21:14,530
I too must attend to my duties.

319
00:21:19,520 --> 00:21:20,650
Take care.

320
00:21:47,520 --> 00:21:49,730
Little friend Ceng Niu,

321
00:21:50,160 --> 00:21:51,930
you're finally back.

322
00:22:20,540 --> 00:22:24,090
To let go of the consequences of my actions

323
00:22:23,840 --> 00:22:25,810
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

324
00:22:25,600 --> 00:22:27,750
like scattered ink.

325
00:22:28,380 --> 00:22:35,230
As destiny falls

326
00:22:31,220 --> 00:22:35,230
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

327
00:22:34,980 --> 00:22:42,830
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

328
00:22:38,220 --> 00:22:42,830
wither and melt into rivers.

329
00:22:43,020 --> 00:22:50,390
Who can deceive

330
00:22:45,780 --> 00:22:50,390
the law of the heavens ?

331
00:22:50,460 --> 00:22:53,710
Countless generations

332
00:22:51,740 --> 00:22:53,710
have tried before me.

333
00:22:53,750 --> 00:22:57,430
But how could I not catch my dreams

334
00:22:55,580 --> 00:22:57,430
within my warm fingers ?

335
00:22:57,740 --> 00:23:01,510
You're at my side when I'm alone

336
00:23:01,260 --> 00:23:04,830
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

337
00:23:05,340 --> 00:23:08,790
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

338
00:23:08,900 --> 00:23:12,990
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

339
00:23:10,740 --> 00:23:12,990
in the streets.

340
00:23:12,900 --> 00:23:17,950
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

341
00:23:14,460 --> 00:23:17,950
Can I break the rules ?

342
00:23:17,710 --> 00:23:20,670
To run towards you !

343
00:23:20,460 --> 00:23:23,990
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

344
00:23:23,740 --> 00:23:28,630
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

345
00:23:28,380 --> 00:23:32,030
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

346
00:23:31,820 --> 00:23:36,710
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

347
00:23:36,910 --> 00:23:42,390
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

348
00:23:42,260 --> 00:23:46,310
If your soul is willing to wander,

349
00:23:46,060 --> 00:23:50,950
can I still take your hands

350
00:23:47,740 --> 00:23:50,950
and hold them tight ?

351
00:23:50,860 --> 00:23:54,030
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

352
00:23:53,780 --> 00:23:58,910
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

353
00:23:58,670 --> 00:24:02,190
I dream of destroying

354
00:24:02,100 --> 00:24:06,910
the shackles of our fate.

355
00:24:06,660 --> 00:24:10,870
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

356
00:24:10,620 --> 00:24:13,670
You're the hardest to let go of.

357
00:24:13,500 --> 00:24:17,550
I want to be with you again

358
00:24:17,380 --> 00:24:20,910
so I can look in your eyes.

359
00:24:20,940 --> 00:24:26,150
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
